WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.968
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:02.969
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:04.570
Thank you for watching.

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:07.407
[ Cheering and applause ]
Thank you for being here.

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:09.275
Let's get to some news.
Well, guys, today

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:12.111
President Biden met
with six state governors

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:15.548
to discuss ways that they can
get more Americans vaccinated.

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:18.618
Yep, they spent about 15 minutes
coming up with ideas

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:20.986
and three hours talking
about if Bennifer is back.

00:00:20.986 --> 00:00:22.889
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:24.590
That's right,
Biden needed more ideas

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.526
after Dr. Fauci refused to pose
for a shirtless calendar.

00:00:27.526 --> 00:00:29.863
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:30.996
He said no.

00:00:30.996 --> 00:00:32.832
It's crazy that this
is still a problem.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:34.133
I mean, even COVID is thinking,

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.835
"I can't believe
I'm re-signing my lease.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.803
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.803 --> 00:00:39.272
I didn't think I could get
the deposit back."

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:40.673
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:43.076
I'm not sure what incentives
to get vaccinated are left.

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:46.712
I mean, so far, we tried food,
alcohol, drugs, gift cards,

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:48.781
sports tickets, money.

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:50.716
Pretty much just leaves sex,
doesn't it?

00:00:50.716 --> 00:00:51.717
I mean, is that
where we're going?

00:00:51.717 --> 00:00:52.985
[ Laughter ]
-Aah!

00:00:52.985 --> 00:00:55.588
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Wow!

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:57.624
-No, no, I'm not doing that.
No, no, no, no, I'm not.

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:00.292
[ The Roots playing funk ]
No, no, no, absolutely, no, no.

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:03.096
-Oh, dear.
-No, I really -- no.

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:05.198
Get vaccinated, everybody,
just please.

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:06.766
[ Laughter and applause ]
-[ Sultry voice ] Get the shot.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:10.636
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.636 --> 00:01:12.004
-That's right,
the government is doing

00:01:12.004 --> 00:01:13.606
all they can
to get people vaccinated.

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:15.908
Today, I read that the Biden
administration is teaming up

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:19.311
with McDonald's to help raise
vaccine awareness.

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:21.314
Yep, so get ready
for the all-new

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:22.849
McDerna.
It's going to be good.

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:24.917
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Whoa, awesome!

00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:26.886
-You know we're living
through historic times

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:29.589
when McDonald's is giving public
health advice, don't you think?

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:31.257
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.193
Yep, McDonald's is even
putting up a billboard

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:34.327
in Times Square that says...

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:38.598
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:44.336
[ Applause ]

00:01:44.336 --> 00:01:46.539
Also, as long as McDonald's
is working to fight disease,

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:48.707
they might want to look
into whatever this thing was.

00:01:48.707 --> 00:01:49.808
I have no idea.

00:01:49.808 --> 00:01:51.144
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:53.379
-Aww.
-Well, here in New York City,

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:55.481
it was just announced
that some subway stations

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:57.984
are offering COVID vaccines.

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.718
Yeah, first,
they sterilize your arm

00:01:59.718 --> 00:02:01.154
with a $2 bottle of vodka

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:03.456
and a paper bag that was left
in the seat,

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:05.324
then, they hold the shot
near your arm

00:02:05.324 --> 00:02:07.293
and a parkour dancer
kicks it in.

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.561
[ Laughter and applause ]
It's going to be amazing.

00:02:09.561 --> 00:02:11.564
This is actually cool --
they even got the MTA announcer

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:13.065
to list all of the side effects.

00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:15.801
"Fever, headaches,
soreness, sweating."

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:18.971
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:18.971 --> 00:02:20.440
Meanwhile, over in Italy,

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.074
a nurse accidentally
gave a woman

00:02:22.074 --> 00:02:25.511
six doses of the Pfizer
vaccine in one shot.

00:02:25.511 --> 00:02:27.747
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.747 --> 00:02:29.115
I think, in Italy,
they call that

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:30.182
family-style.

00:02:30.182 --> 00:02:34.820
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.589
Six doses of the vaccine.

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:40.126
I'm 99% sure this is how every
Marvel movie starts, isn't it?

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:42.462
[ Laughter ]
"Save us, Captain Pfizer!"

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:44.296
[ Laughter ]
At this point,

00:02:44.296 --> 00:02:45.965
she's now protected
from COVID-19,

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:47.733
-20, -21, -22...

00:02:47.733 --> 00:02:49.836
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.304
Well, just when we thought
we made it

00:02:51.304 --> 00:02:52.671
through the worst
of the pandemic,

00:02:52.671 --> 00:02:55.408
the next big threat
to public health has arrived.

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:56.709
-Starbucks is launching

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:59.512
the strawberry funnel cake
frappuccino.

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:00.846
[ Laughter ]
It has as many calories

00:03:00.846 --> 00:03:02.949
as a double cheeseburger
at McDonald's.

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:05.818
It's a blend of strawberry purée
and whipped cream

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:08.921
with funnel cake pieces
and powdered sugar.

00:03:08.921 --> 00:03:10.390
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:12.492
-If you want one,
just walk in and say,

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:13.860
"Venti diabeté."

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:17.697
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:18.865
You know someone's going
to be like,

00:03:18.865 --> 00:03:20.599
"I'll take
a funnel cake frappuccino,

00:03:20.599 --> 00:03:22.368
but can I get it
with skim milk?"

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:24.337
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.337 --> 00:03:25.672
[ Hushed ]
Thank you.

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:27.206
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.206 --> 00:03:29.742
Some entertainment news.
I saw that ABC just renewed

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:32.211
"Grey's Anatomy"
for an 18th season.

00:03:32.211 --> 00:03:35.215
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Oh.

00:03:37.317 --> 00:03:39.251
-Even the cicadas
coming back are like,

00:03:39.251 --> 00:03:40.452
"This show is still on?"

00:03:40.452 --> 00:03:42.721
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:42.721 --> 00:03:43.790
Well, this is one
of our favorite

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.357
sporting events every year.

00:03:45.357 --> 00:03:48.894
Russian President Vladimir Putin
plays in a hockey game

00:03:48.894 --> 00:03:51.464
with professional players,
and, every year,

00:03:51.464 --> 00:03:52.465
he does amazing.

00:03:52.465 --> 00:03:53.833
-Really?
-Yeah.

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:55.034
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.070
In this game,
he scores eight goals.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.137
-Eight goals?!
-Watch this. Yeah, watch.

00:03:58.137 --> 00:04:00.906
-[ Russian accent ]
Vladimir Putin.

00:04:00.906 --> 00:04:03.409
[ Speaking Russian ]

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:04.744
-Whoa!

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:06.045
Hey-oh!

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:07.480
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:09.548
Going to -- What?

00:04:09.548 --> 00:04:10.983
Oh!

00:04:10.983 --> 00:04:12.985
Here he comes and -- yep!

00:04:12.985 --> 00:04:14.653
♪♪

00:04:14.653 --> 00:04:18.724
And there, yeah, fall down now.

00:04:18.724 --> 00:04:20.393
Oops! Yeah, he slipped.

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:22.428
Eight goals, amazing.
Unbelievable.

00:04:22.428 --> 00:04:25.598
One shot was blocked
and the goalie was later

00:04:25.598 --> 00:04:27.366
"accidentally" run over
by a Zamboni.

00:04:27.366 --> 00:04:29.735
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:04:29.735 --> 00:04:32.905
And, finally, I saw that
the cost of wood is increasing,

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:36.209
which is making toilet paper
more expensive.

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:37.577
Maybe that's why Dr. Fauci
was like,

00:04:37.577 --> 00:04:39.912
"Well, let's not throw out
those face masks just yet."

